<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Verify your email address</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #1a2332;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 20px;">Confirm your Sport E account</h1>
    <p>Hi {{ displayName }},</p>
    <p>Please confirm this email address belongs to you by opening the link below. The link is valid for one hour.</p>
    <p>
        <a href="{{ url }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #1d4ed8;
            color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">Verify my email</a>
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555;">
        If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br>
        <a href="{{ url }}">{{ url }}</a>
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555;">If you did not create this account, you can ignore this message.</p>
</body>
</html>
